  "typical_application": "Frequency divide-by-2 (Q-bar to D), data latching/synchronization, momentary-to-toggle conversion.",
  "gotchas": [
    "pin 7 = GND, pin 14 = VCC",
    "PRE (pins 4/10) and CLR (pins 1/13) are asynchronous and ACTIVE LOW; tie HIGH when unused or the flip-flop is held set/reset",
    "data is captured on the rising clock edge only; respect setup/hold times",
    "do not assert PRE and CLR LOW simultaneously (indeterminate state)",
    "flip-flop 2 pin order is mirrored: Q-bar (8) and Q (9) come before PRE/CLK/D/CLR"
